row('ground-set alphabet',r'L/scr L then plain L',r'plain L',r'cal L consistently','The baseline L has a looped foot and curved upper stroke; the same form recurs in the three endpoint conditions and bottom examples.','025_top.jpg; 025_examples.jpg','misread symbol or index','medium'),
row('nondegeneracy conditions',r'non/ici; old [/i; or(L); old a; b/a; ex(L)',r'non; 0(L); b; omega(L); old marks omitted',r'non; old [/i retained; or(cal L); old a retained; b; ex(cal L)','Non has its two short humps. Or and ex each contain two separate letters, not a single endpoint glyph; the live letter above the old blotted a has a tall b-stem. The crossed opening stroke and old a remain doubtful.','025_top.jpg','misread symbol or index','high',marked=True),
row('large subsegment heading',r'large underlined and live; fermé inserted',r'large struck',r'C’s underline and insertion retained','The long line runs below the whole phrase, including large; it does not cross large. Fermé sits above the baseline with its own short underline.','025_large.jpg','deletion state','high',C=False),
row('wide definition wording',r'ss-tronçon/s-tronçon; réduit/réduite',r'ss-tronçon; réduite',r'ss-tronçon; réduit/réduite retained','The abbreviation begins with two small s forms before the hyphen. The end of réduit is too compressed to decide whether a final e is represented; no grammatical completion is supplied.','025_large.jpg','misread word','medium'),
row('cancelled boundary definition',r'whole block deleted; full set formula; frontier line doubtful; canonique doubtful; old T cap L/overline L',r'fragments struck but most prose live; set tail unread; old overline T cap complement T',r'whole block deleted; canonique resolved; other local C doubts retained','Widely spaced diagonal strokes cross from pose through the entire block and examples. Within this cancellation, the first formula visibly has t in T and t in overline(L minus T). Canonique can be read beneath its local horizontal strike; the frontier line’s final point and the older equality remain uncertain.','025_cancelled.jpg; 025_examples.jpg','deletion state','high',marked=True),
row('boundary description',r'fermé de ses extrémités',r'fini de ses extrémités',r'fermé de ses extrémités, deleted','The final accent sits beyond the connected middle humps of fermé; there is no separate first i-dot. The word remains under the global cancellation.','025_ferme.jpg','misread word','medium',C=False),
row('four boundary examples',r'all four formulas deleted',r'all four formulas live',r'C deletion retained','The outer cancellation strokes descend through the text and cross the line of three examples, then curve through the final partial L equals empty-set formula. The relation signs, a-indices and braces are legible.','025_examples.jpg','deletion state','high',C=False),
